  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "-yeah and then I told him to buzz off. You should\u2019ve seen the look
      on his face, it was priceless. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: ---
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Ahh alright gotcha, well have fun with that, I guess. At least you\u2019re
      not the only one missing, that weirdo Bradley and his lackeys always pick on
      isn\u2019t here either. Maybe finally took the hint and switched schools or
      something. Was weirdly happy the past few days too, as if they\u2019d already
      found a new place that\u2019d take \u2018em."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: ---
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: '*laughs* you think so?? Yeah, I can imagine that, seems cowardly enough. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: ---
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Wouldn\u2019t be the first time. But anyway, I gotta go, I heard that
      there\u2019s been a fight in the cafeteria yesterday and I missed it. I\u2019ve
      gotta get my hands on all the juicy details as long as they\u2019re still hot,
      yknow? No one likes their tea cold after all, hahah. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 1
    text: "The cafeteria, huh? Sounds like I\u2019ll be able to overhear more there.  "
    videoEventId: 
